20
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:26,210
[SPEAKER_01] Pjevaj sokole,

21
00:03:27,860 --> 00:03:40,850
[SPEAKER_01] pjesmom pobjede. Preko Knina Dinare preko zemlje Slobodne. O.

22
00:03:40,970 --> 00:03:47,810
[SPEAKER_01] Neka te ljudi vide. I nek se pjesma digne visoko gore do neba.

23
00:03:49,610 --> 00:03:54,680
[SPEAKER_01] Nek se oluja nosi poleti i prkosi.

24
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:21,250
[SPEAKER_02] O. O.

25
00:04:24,670 --> 00:04:30,100
[SPEAKER_02] O. O. O.

26
00:04:33,580 --> 00:04:35,830
[SPEAKER_01] Neka te ljudi vide?

27
00:04:42,010 --> 00:04:43,210
[SPEAKER_02] Tko?

28
00:04:46,630 --> 00:04:48,640
